@rameshraghupathy did you validate your PR fix to confirm both these issues are fixed with this PR?

1. "show reboot-cause all" command is executed - only the last NPU reboot cause is seen (It should show last reboot cause of NPU + DPUs)
2. when the "show reboot-cause history" command is executed the DPU reboot causes are mis represented as NPU reboot causes (the device is shown as NPU instead of the relevant DPU

> @rameshraghupathy can you update the CLI in this doc https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-utilities/blob/master/doc/Command-Reference.md . There is a "reboot-cause" section

Done
@prgeor
